{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1504814-what-are-some-creative-arts-and-realms-combinations-that-you-are-aware-of","id":1504814,"title":"What are some creative Arts and Realms combinations that you are aware of?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-07T23:40:35-08:00","id":1504814,"title":"What are some creative Arts and Realms combinations that you are aware of?","content":"Some of the Arts and Realms combos don't seem to go together well at first glance. Take Sovereign + [Scene, Prop, or Time]. Those things aren't sentient, so why would it obey a Sovereign command? I can sort of see how it may affect Nature, and certainly Fae and Actor, but the others seem like a stretch or impossibility. But perhaps I am wrong. Similarly, something like Metamorphosis + Time doesn't make any sense to me, but I know many players come up with creative pairings. I'm curious to hear yours if you have them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26676-squiggles","name":"Squiggles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-08T03:49:30-08:00","id":1504832,"title":"","content":"In C20, Scene isn't a primary Realm, so you can only add it on for a Cantrip to target a wider area. Same goes for Time, it can't be used as a primary Realm.<br /> <br /> Sovereign totally works on objects though. You can use Dictum on a door saying &quot;open&quot;, and the door will open. As to being impossible, well, this is magic, and the Dreaming, impossible happens all the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T07:25:34-08:00","id":1504935,"title":"","content":"A good example of Dictum with Prop is a Sidhe Knight of House Dougal commanding a Technocratic Union Black Suit's smart watch to unlock; the watch has all sorts of failsafes for failed login attempts, but strangely the designers didn't fairy-proof it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T10:03:31-08:00","id":1504950,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Prop is the easiest of the three to deal with: you just cast a spell on an item or an object. Tell a computer to &quot;forget&quot; certain data, &quot;heal&quot; a broken window, speed up a vehicle, forbid a knife from cutting, etc. Time is used to add delays or extend durations. Scene just extends the number of targets or the area of effect.<br /> <br /> A long time ago, for an online game, I tried to come up with a way to pair every Art with every Realm. It's all here: <a href=\"https://wiki.rpol.net/?id=63447/Changes%20to%20Arts\" target=\"_blank\">https://wiki.rpol.net/?id=63447/Changes%20to%20Arts</a> This was mostly written pre-C20, but it may give you some ideas. Re-reading them, I'm still pleased with some of those ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}